{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-7","kind":"proposition","title":"在给定圆外作外切正方形","englishTitle":"About a given circle to circumscribe a square.","book":4,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.7/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","contentId":"euclid-4-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af905dc56168e56f782cbaa163c60c8d75934af850023ff3be8432fac152e061","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-7.statement","euclid-4-7.construction.1","euclid-4-7.construction.2","euclid-4-7.proof.1","euclid-4-7.proof.2","euclid-4-7.proof.3","euclid-4-7.proof.4","euclid-4-7.proof.5","euclid-4-7.proof.6","euclid-4-7.proof.7","euclid-4-7.proof.8","euclid-4-7.proof.9","euclid-4-7.proof.10","euclid-4-7.proof.11","euclid-4-7.proof.12","euclid-4-7.conclusion","euclid-4-7.historical.1","euclid-4-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9799cdf43ec88d72da819aadd05e49e66b025f476503cf3b75b29c05ce3e1d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"About a given circle to circumscribe a square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"大约一个圈子可以环绕正方形"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作外切圜直角方形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有圆求作外切圆正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"445795a2c8e6883338b130a45704c4067fe294172cde9bdbd54a4f414dedac81","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be the given circle; thus it is required to circumscribe a square about the circle ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD是给定的圆圈;因此,需要将圈圈圈的正方形限定为ABCD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"572c4a3094d687cdb88d77972bd4e02271ce6dc57874298ae53bb5ed9fbbab30","citations":["euclid-3-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two diameters AC, BD of the circle ABCD be drawn at right angles to one another, and through the points A, B, C, D let FG, GH, HK, KF be drawn touching the circle ABCD. [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABCD圆的直径为AC,BD,在直角之间绘制,通过A、B、C、D FG、GH、HK、KF点绘制,接近ABCD圆。 [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0777a93515a86af4b63f0fa4ca40d185f0a45414e088f2e034b6d2de464c6b42","citations":["euclid-3-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since FG touches the circle ABCD, and EA has been joined from the centre E to the point of contact at A, therefore the angles at A are right. [[III. 18](/principles/euclid-3-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG接过了ABCD圈,EA从A时的中心连接到接触点,因此,A时的该角是直角。 [[III. 18](/principles/euclid-3-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6716f942167c1da4dd9f01ac147357fc135a9a68f65ff1f3bf0552114cb193ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angles at the points B, C, D are also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,B点、C点、D点的角度也是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69f867801269c74aa39b727513f26bdf9a4cbf1a951fab6fdf318d9fbdd7ca08","citations":["euclid-1-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the angle AEB is right, and the angle EBG is also right, therefore GH is parailel to AC. [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于角度AEB是正确的, 角度EBG也是正确的, 因此GH是parilel到AC。 [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb16633db18fa6abfd3d6f684081bfdd0f283958ffe6ee263257b84cf8d8406c","citations":["euclid-1-30"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason AC is also parallel to FK, so that GH is also parallel to FK. [[I. 30](/principles/euclid-1-30)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,AC也与FK并行,因此GH也与FK并行。 [[I. 30](/principles/euclid-1-30)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82566a7ab0e051a4829a9a80c5c6e2dfcc58adc8fb22af6fe479b3c34405cc09","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that each of the straight lines GF, HK is parallel to BED."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,GF、HK直线的每一个线都与BED线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ef2843b7d6bc9b8a7cbcdd2cbba6e3a9d399da94ae3daf3eb5bcfb8c1cc6ee9","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore GK, GC, AK, FB, BK are parallelograms; therefore GF is equal to HK, and GH to FK. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GK、GC、AK、FB、BK是平行四边形;因此,GF等于HK,GH至FK。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"169026afd0e3e2a2839fcf9f2a9bc41c34f22807932a91fd27f358ef503501be","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC is equal to BD, and AC is also equal to each of the straight lines GH, FK, while BD is equal to each of the straight lines GF, HK, [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] therefore the quadrilateral FGHK is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AC等于BD,AC也等于每条直线GH,FK,BD等于每条直线GF,HK,因此,四边FGHK是等边的。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d7d29c3f46132f8bb598bf7d4787233be7cb001fd3792c395cb3f6f4872e4fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also right-angled."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是个正经问题。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e815c9bcd15275837ad378e4cbc16a8c002f74006d388d843a77c36c8a032857","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since GBEA is a parallelogram, and the angle AEB is right, therefore the angle AGB is also right. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,GBEA是平行四边形,AEB该角是直角,因此AGB角度也是正确的。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c39ae73569bb382ed6643b69668d75a6fb66fbfd13e573f1a2b7b7b3f4a056e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the angles at H, K, F are also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,H、K、F的角度也是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08bc1f2e5182317fbebbfaad8abc1dc640470d928e453ef3a8efb893f59a8023","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FGHK is right-angled."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以FGHK是正弦的"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"367dfe10cfa42d9c0fd3b1376eb0f0198f9929338c717e7757102a20e0bc8422","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved equilateral; therefore it is a square; and it has been circumscribed about the circle ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,它也是等边的;因此,它是正方形;它被限定为ABCD圈。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5b75378a40b79258111e9ced8a3839f248941e68c876b4e80a31d3a409e526e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore about the given circle a square has been circumscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,关于给定的圆圈,正方形已经限定为Q,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68aa9006633dc565d2c301704edbd438555784e73fab4fac7379b0eed9f71f3d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作外切圜直角方形法曰甲乙丙丁圜其心戊求作外切圜直角方形先作甲丙乙丁两径线以直角相交于戊次于甲乙丙丁作庚己己辛辛壬壬庚四线为两径之垂线而相遇于己于辛于壬于庚即己庚壬辛为外切圜直角方形论曰甲戊乙己乙戊既皆直角即己辛甲丙平行〈一卷〉〈廿八〉依显甲丙庚壬亦平行则己庚辛壬亦平行〈一卷三十〉又甲丙辛己既直角形即甲丙己辛必等〈一卷卅四〉而甲丙辛甲己辛两角亦等甲丙辛既直角即甲己辛亦直角依显庚壬辛亦直角而辛壬壬庚庚己三边俱等于甲丙乙丁两径既四边俱等于两径则己庚壬辛为直角方形而四边各切圜〈三卷十六之系〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有圆求作外切圆正方形作图方法如下：甲乙丙丁圆其心戊求作外切圆正方形先作甲丙乙丁两径线以直角相交于戊次于甲乙丙丁作庚己己辛辛壬壬庚四线为两径之垂线而相遇于己于辛于壬于庚即己庚壬辛为外切圆正方形证明如下：甲戊乙己乙戊既皆直角即己辛甲丙平行〈一卷〉〈廿八〉依显甲丙庚壬亦平行则己庚辛壬亦平行〈一卷三十〉又甲丙辛己既矩形即甲丙己辛必等〈一卷卅四〉而甲丙辛甲己辛两角亦等甲丙辛既直角即甲己辛亦直角依显庚壬辛亦直角而辛壬壬庚庚己三边都等于甲丙乙丁两径既四边都等于两径则己庚壬辛为正方形而四边各切圆〈三卷十六之系〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-7.source","contentId":"euclid-4-7","revisionId":"euclid-4-7@raw-af905dc56168e56f","order":17,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34b39ba99ca73fb20fc0b17a765512ecc84d6e7955567295acd340ce3fe13384","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-7:euclid-3-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-7.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-